ORDINANCE NO.
Date:_7-3-/3
AMENDMENT, SECTION5.1.2, ZONING DISTRICTS ESTABLISHED, AND
SECTION5.1.3, OFFICIAL ZONING MAP, OF THE CHEYENNE UNIFIED
DEVELOPMENT CODE, CHANGING THE ZONING CLASSIFICATION FROM
